cff-version: 1.2.0
title: market-data-normalizer
abstract: >-
  A pure-Python library that normalizes heterogeneous market-data feeds
  into one exchange-agnostic event schema, and computes research features
  that cannot see the future. Exact decimal prices, integer nanosecond
  timestamps, no runtime dependencies.
message: If you use this software in published work, please cite it.
type: software
authors:
  - name: HarvestGroup360
    website: https://harvestgroup360.com
repository-code: https://github.com/Harvestgroup360/market-data-normalizer
url: https://harvestgroup360.com
license: MIT
keywords:
  - market data
  - quantitative finance
  - look-ahead bias
  - point-in-time data
  - tick data
